    "statement": "For any finite layered deterministic total system and declared final observation, equality of complete remaining suffix signatures is a congruence for each next action; the induced quotient transition is well-defined; every declared suffix observation factors through q_i; and any classifier sufficient for all remaining suffix outputs refines q_i.",
