      "Soundness is immediate from equality of the full suffix functions.",
      "If sigma_i(s)=sigma_i(t), then for each action a the residual suffix functions of T_i^a(s) and T_i^a(t) are equal, so q_{i+1}(T_i^a(s))=q_{i+1}(T_i^a(t)); hence descended transitions are well-defined.",
      "Every word output is a coordinate of sigma_i, so it factors through q_i.",
      "If a classifier recovers every remaining word output, it recovers their finite product sigma_i, so its kernel refines ker(sigma_i)."
